22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #Here's feedback on the updated `bitgrid.js`:
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #Changes Made
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- The broken line in `drawMask` has been fixed (the `(char=="O")` part is now commented out).
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- No other significant changes.
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #Remaining Issues
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #• 1. `writePixels` is still fragile and buggy*
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #The current implementation has several problems:
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- It reads `word` before the loop, but only writes it back at certain boundaries.
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- Modifying `x` inside the loop while also using `(x&31)` creates confusing state.
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- If the starting `x` is not aligned, or if the write crosses multiple word boundaries incorrectly,
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #data can be corrupted.
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #• 2. Wrapping inconsistency (still present)*
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1354 [grok-build-0.1] #- `getPixel()` does toroidal wrapping.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #- `setPixel()`, `writePixels()`, `rect()`, and `drawMask()` do not wrap.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #This mismatch will cause subtle bugs, especially during cellular automata steps near the edges.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #• 3. `drawMask` still uses `setPixel`*
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #This is very slow for anything more than tiny drawings because it calls `setPixel` (which does
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #offset math) for every single pixel.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #• 4. Performance of `stepConwayLife`*
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #This is still the biggest performance issue. `countNeighbors` calls `getPixel` 8 times per cell,
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #and `getPixel` performs wrapping and offset calculations every time.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #Recommendations
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #A. Fix `setPixel` to be consistent
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #You should decide on wrapping behavior. I recommend making `setPixel` also wrap (like `getPixel`),
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #or add a comment documenting the difference.
22cd1355 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #B. Consider a faster `stepConwayLife`
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #Would you like me to provide an optimized version of `stepConwayLife` that works directly with
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #32-bit words instead of calling `getPixel`/`countNeighbors` for every cell?
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #This usually gives a 5-10x speedup on larger grids.
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #C. Quick fixes I would apply right now
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #Here are the minimal targeted fixes:
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #1. Fix `setPixel` missing semicolon (style + safety)
22cd1356 [grok-build-0.1] #2. Improve `writePixels` (or replace it)
