22e0820b [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Memory access**     │  Inconsistent use of `this.read()` vs direct `this.memory[]` access  │  Use `read()` for *all* loads that could hit hardware (especially `0x0c00` and POKEY). Writes should probably go through a `write()` method too.  │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **ASL**               │  Sets carry twice                                                    │  Remove the manual carry logic after `setCarry(carry)`.                                                                                           │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **setStatus**         │  Does not touch Carry                                                │  This is probably intentional, but worth documenting.                                                                                             │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Stack operations**  │  PHA/PHP/PLA/PLP/JSR/RTS have slightly different styles              │  Standardize on pre-decrement push / post-increment pull.                                                                                         │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Interrupt**         │  IRQ pushes only PC, not status                                      │  Real 6502 IRQ also pushes the status register.                                                                                                   │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Performance**       │  Interpreter in a hot loop with console output                       │  Consider making the trace optional (very expensive).                                                                                             │
22e0820c [grok-build-0.1] #│  **Input**             │  `this.input[0]` is being used for vblank + test                     │  Consider separating input ports from system flags.                                                                                               │
