241e9b99 [kimi-k3] #`C052/53` picks full vs mixed. Integer BASIC's `GR` touches both `C050` and `C053` (and `C056`, and
241e9b99 [kimi-k3] #`C054` page 1). So a single `displayMode` enum works if you update it on every switch access, but
